<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY APPOINTMENTS</view><view class="title">我的预约</view><view class="subtitle">只展示你的预约，其他顾客身份不可见。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{ready&&!appointments.length}}" class="empty">还没有预约，到护理页选一个项目吧。</view><view wx:for="{{appointments}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="heading">{{item.service_name}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.statusText}}</view></view><view>{{item.timeText}} · {{item.duration}} 分钟</view><view class="muted">{{item.note}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status==='PENDING'||item.status==='CONFIRMED'}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy}}">取消预约 · 不扣次</button></view></view>
